{#-
  Cover letter template.

  Inputs are merged from applicant.yaml (reusable facts) and an application file
  (per-job fields). Run `npm run letter -- <application>` to render.

  Placeholders you SHOULD edit per application:
    role, company, source, greeting, opening, why_company, closing, themes

  Placeholders the script fills from applicant.yaml:
    name, email, linkedin, location, and every paragraph in `paragraphs`
-#}
{{ greeting }},

{{ opening }}

{% for theme in themes %}{{ paragraphs[theme] }}

{% endfor %}Why {{ company }}

{{ why_company }}

{{ closing }}

Thank you for your time and consideration.

Kind regards,

{{ name }}
{{ email }}
{{ linkedin }}{% if location %} · {{ location }}{% endif %}
